Package: hfdBasicIndicators
Type: Package
Title: Calculation functions for production of the HFD basic indicators
Version: 2.0-1077
Date: 2015-04-26
Author: Edward Nash <nash@demogr.mpg.de>
Maintainer: Edward Nash <edward.nash@gmx.de>
Depends: hfdLexisManipulation
Description: This package contains functions used for production of the basic indicators such as
  age-specific fertility rate (ASFR), total fertility rate (TFR), mean age at birth (MAB), etc.
  for countries in the Human Fertility Database. The functions implement the algorithms
  described in the HFD Methods Protocol.
License: GPL (>= 2.0)
LazyLoad: yes
URL: http://www.humanfertility.org
Packaged: 2015-04-26 13:01:28 UTC; Ed
